onnect\\\"))\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"spec\",\n          \"quote\": \"U1 TPS62933 bucks +24V \u2192 +5V ... \u2500\u25ba +5V rail\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"With EN left open, the buck regulator is not reliably enabled and its internal pull-down can keep it disabled; the +5V rail and downstream powered circuitry may therefore fail to operate.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.97\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Anomalies are present: a TMC2209 motor output is merged with I2C_SDA, and the main buck regulator's enable pin is left unconnected. Either can prevent intended board operation.\"\n}",
